  {
   "start": 37.78,
   "end": 59.43,
   "text": "Um, and then I bought more because I want all of the doorways to have my little two-inch tall marble figures across the top. Kind of like in ancient Rome where all of the, uh, temples, they have three-dimensional, like, Star Wars when people are frozen in carbonite."
