  },
  {
   "start": 78.43,
   "end": 112.34,
   "text": "So, um, yeah, yesterday I slept in, uh, as much as I could. I had to interview with a roommate, prospective roommate. And my mom's gonna call the references because I, uh, yeah, cause she likes to help me out. Um, seems cool. I want a young, uh, enthusiastic person."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.34,
