   "text": "Um, but then I kind of stayed here. Kind of, I guess, took a little while to get out. And, uh, by the time I got out, it was, like, three or something. So, I tried to hurry out. And, uh, yeah, but I figured if I could stay out until dark, until, like, eight, that I could get a good ride in. You know? Cause I still had, like, five hours of, uh, daylight. So, um, I, uh, yeah, I took off."
  },
  {
   "start": 144.96,
   "end": 160.24,
