  },
  {
   "start": 161.58,
   "end": 170.42,
   "text": "So, but you can't ride the pavement, though, on the side gutter. But, so, but that's not much claiming anyway. That was, that was back when I was, like, first riding and totally out of shape."
  },
  {
   "start": 170.42,
   "end": 182.8,
